{"sha": "fb02aa34aa05fb187efabad90f134c2587f65eb45006f6831ae15540f4dadde8", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:viscous-flows} 章 --- 黏性流动}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:1}", "$\\tau = \\eta U/h = 0.25 \\times 2/2 \\times 10^{-4} = \\qty{2.5}{kPa}$; $F = \\qty{1.25}{kN}$;", "$P = Fv = \\qty{2.5}{kW}$。干摩擦：$0.3 \\times 98 = \\qty{29}{N}$ --- 此处", "薄而快速剪切的油膜阻力大得多；黏性阻力按", "$U/h$ 增长，因此润滑在较低速度、较厚油膜下更为有效（且", "它永远不会卡死）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:2}", "(a) $2 \\times 10^{-6} \\times 3 \\times 10^{-5}/10^{-6} = 6 \\times 10^{-5}$，蠕动流。(b)", "$1.8 \\times 1.5/10^{-6} = 2.7 \\times 10^6$，湍流。(c) $4 \\times 30/1.5 \\times 10^{-5}", "= 8 \\times 10^6$，湍流。(d) $0.025 \\times 0.33/3.3 \\times 10^{-6} = 2500$，", "临界层流。(e) $900 \\times 0.5 \\times 0.01/0.1 = 45$，层流。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:3}", "$D_V = \\pi R^4\\Delta P/8\\eta L = \\pi(2 \\times 10^{-4})^4 \\times 2 \\times 10^4/(8 \\times 10^{-3}", "\\times 0.03) = \\qty{0.42}{mL/s}$；\\qty{12}{s} 可收集 \\qty{5}{mL}。$v_{\\max} = \\Delta PR^2/", "4\\eta L = \\qty{6.7}{m/s}$, $\\langle v\\rangle = \\qty{3.3}{m/s}$, $\\mathrm{Re} = 2R\\langle v", "\\rangle/\\nu = 1300$：层流。$\\tau_w = \\Delta PR/2L = \\qty{67}{Pa}$。在", "\\qty{0.8}{mm} 处流量增至十六倍，即 \\qty{6.7}{mL/s} --- 但 $\\mathrm{Re} \\approx 10^4$：流动", "转为湍流，增益较小。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:4}", "$v_\\infty = 2R^2\\Delta\\rho\\,g/9\\eta$。(a) \\qty{1.3}{cm/s}，$\\mathrm{Re} = 0.02$，", "每米 \\qty{75}{s}。(b) \\qty{0.24}{mm/s}，$\\mathrm{Re} = 3 \\times 10^{-5}$，\\qty{70}{min} 每米。", "(c) \\qty{1.2}{m/s}，但 $\\mathrm{Re} = 16$：斯托克斯公式高估了（实际", "速率约 \\qty{0.7}{m/s}），每米约一秒。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:5}", "(a) $\\langle v\\rangle = 0.1/0.0707 = \\qty{1.4}{m/s}$, $\\mathrm{Re} = 4.2 \\times 10^5$. (b)", "$8\\eta LD_V/\\pi R^4 = \\qty{500}{Pa}$. (c) $\\lambda = 0.3/25.5 = 0.0118$, $\\Delta P = 0.0118", "\\times 3333 \\times 1000 = \\qty{39}{kPa}$：是原来的 $80$ 倍；$P = \\Delta PD_V = \\qty{3.9}{kW}$。", "(d) 速率相同，$\\mathrm{Re} = 3 \\times 10^5$，$\\lambda = 0.0128$，$\\Delta P = 0.0128 \\times 4717", "\\times 1000 = \\qty{60}{kPa}$，\\qty{6}{kW}：单位流量下管壁更多，损失更大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:6}", "(a) $v = 2 \\times 25 \\times 10^{-12} \\times 50 \\times 9.81/(9 \\times 10^{-3}) = \\qty{2.7}{\\micro m/s}$;", "沉降 \\qty{5}{cm} 需 $1.8 \\times 10^4$ s，即五小时。(b) \\qty{2.7}{mm/s}，\\qty{18}{s}。(c)", "$\\Omega = \\sqrt{1000g/r} = \\qty{313}{rad/s} = \\qty{3000}{rpm}$。(d) $v \\propto R^2$，", "大颗粒先沉降；依次提高转速离心，", "即可按粒径分离。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:7}", "(a) $F = 0.6 \\times 144 \\times 0.35 = \\qty{30}{N}$, $+\\qty{4}{N}$: $P = 34 \\times 12 =", "\\qty{410}{W}$。(b) $47 + 4 = \\qty{51}{N}$，\\qty{770}{W}。(c) 相对速率", "\\qty{17}{m/s}：$61 + 4 = \\qty{65}{N}$，乘以地面速率：\\qty{780}{W}。(d)", "阻力 $\\qty{21}{N}$：\\qty{300}{W}，节省 \\qty{110}{W}。(e) $mg\\sin\\alpha = \\qty{39}{N} =", "4 + 0.21v^2$: $v = \\qty{13}{m/s}$, \\qty{47}{km/h}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:8}", "(a) 高尔夫球：$\\tfrac12\\rho C_xS = \\qty{2.2e-4}{kg/m}$，$v_\\infty = \\sqrt{0.45/2.2 \\times 10^{-4}}", "= \\qty{45}{m/s}$；跳伞者 $\\sqrt{785/0.42} = \\qty{43}{m/s}$；降落伞 $\\sqrt{785/15} =", "\\qty{7.2}{m/s}$。(b) $m\\dot v = mg - kv^2$，即 $\\dot v = g(1 - v^2/v_\\infty^2)$，", "其从静止出发的解为 $v_\\infty\\tanh(gt/v_\\infty)$。(c) 当 $\\tanh x = 0.9$ 时", "$x = 1.47$: $t = 1.47 \\times 43/9.81 = \\qty{6.5}{s}$; $z = (v_\\infty^2/g)\\ln\\cosh x =", "190 \\times 0.83 = \\qty{160}{m}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:9}", "(a) 剪切速率 $\\Omega R/e = 0.5/10^{-3} = \\qty{500}{s^{-1}}$；$\\Gamma = \\tau\\cdot2\\pi Rh", "\\cdot R$: $\\tau = 0.02/(2\\pi \\times 2.5 \\times 10^{-3} \\times 0.1) = \\qty{12.7}{Pa}$. (b) $\\eta", "= 12.7/500 = \\qty{2.5e-2}{Pa.s}$. (c) $\\mathrm{Re} = \\rho Ue/\\eta \\approx 1000 \\times 0.5 \\times", "10^{-3}/0.025 = 20$：层流。(d) 薄间隙使剪切速率均匀", "（平面近似），并使流动保持层流。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:10}", "$D_V = \\qty{8.3e-5}{m^3/s}$. (a) $R_h = 8\\eta L/\\pi R^4 = 8 \\times 3.5 \\times 10^{-3} \\times", "0.4/(\\pi \\times 2.4 \\times 10^{-8}) = \\qty{1.5e5}{Pa.s/m^3}$, $\\Delta P = \\qty{12}{Pa}$. (b)", "单根毛细血管 $\\qty{3.5e16}{Pa.s/m^3}$；$10^{10}$ 根并联：\\qty{3.5e6}{Pa.s/m^3}；", "$\\Delta P = \\qty{290}{Pa}$（\\qty{2}{mmHg}）。(c) 单根小动脉 $8 \\times 3.5 \\times 10^{-3}", "\\times 2 \\times 10^{-3}/(\\pi \\times 10^{-20}) = \\qty{1.8e15}{Pa.s/m^3}$；整组：", "\\qty{1.8e7}{Pa.s/m^3}；$\\Delta P = \\qty{1.5}{kPa}$：小动脉主导了", "两者的阻力（压强降发生在小血管，", "而非大血管）。(d) $P = 13000 \\times 8.3 \\times 10^{-5} = \\qty{1.1}{W}$，约 $1\\%$。(e)", "$(1/1.1)^4 = 0.68$：约三分之一的小动脉阻力被去除 ---", "血管扩张剂正是通过这种方式降低血压。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:11}", "(a) $F = b\\int_0^L\\tau_w\\,\\dd x = 0.332\\rho U^2b\\sqrt{\\nu/U}\\int_0^L\\dd x/\\sqrt x =", "0.664\\rho U^2b\\sqrt{\\nu L/U} = 0.664\\rho U^2bL/\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Re}_L}$. (b) $\\mathrm{Re}_L =", "3 \\times 10^5$（层流）；$\\delta \\approx 5\\sqrt{\\nu L/U} = \\qty{9}{mm}$；$F = 0.664 \\times 1000", "\\times 0.09 \\times 1/548 = \\qty{0.11}{N}$（每面），共 \\qty{0.22}{N}。(c) $\\mathrm{Re}_L = 10^7$：", "边界层在最初几厘米之后转为湍流，层流", "公式失效（实际阻力为其数倍）。(d) $\\mathrm{Re}_x =", "10^9$: $\\delta \\approx 0.37 \\times 100/63 = \\qty{0.6}{m}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:viscous-flows:12}", "(a) $0 = \\rho g + \\eta v''(y)$，$v(0) = 0$（无滑移），$v'(h) = 0$（自由", "表面处无应力）。(b) 两次积分：$v = (\\rho g/2\\eta)(2hy - y^2)$；$q =", "\\int_0^hv\\,\\dd y = \\rho gh^3/3\\eta$. (c) $v_s = \\rho gh^2/2\\eta = 1200 \\times 9.81 \\times", "4 \\times 10^{-8}/1 = \\qty{0.47}{mm/s}$；$q = \\qty{6.3e-8}{m^2/s}$；十", "分钟流出 \\qty{28}{cm} --- 这一厚度的牛顿涂料会流失；实际", "涂料呈剪切变稀与触变性，", "而且过厚时仍会下垂，因为 $v_s \\propto h^2$。(d) $1400 \\times 9.81 \\times 4 \\times 10^{-6}/20 = \\qty{2.7}{mm/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:viscous-flows:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $S = \\qty{4.9}{cm^2}$, $\\langle v\\rangle = 83/4.9 = \\qty{0.17}{m/s}$; $\\mathrm{Re}", "= 1060 \\times 0.17 \\times 0.025/3.5 \\times 10^{-3} = 1300$：层流（脉动峰值", "可达 $\\sim 5000$）。", ""]}